Z2 is optionally substituted hydroxycycloalkyl or optionally substituted hydroxyheterocyclyl: 

 Z4 is O and NR4; m is 0; n is 2 or 3; p + q = 0 or 1 ; R,a and R,b are independently optionally substituted alkyl, optionally substituted alkoxy, optionally substituted cycloalkyloxy, optionally substituted heterocyclyloxy or 

 or one of R,d and Rlb is hydrogen or halo;
